  "question": {
    "text": "A cubical vessel of height \\(1 \\mathrm{~m}\\) is full of water. What is the amount of work done in pumping water out of the vessel? (Take \\(\\mathrm{g}=\\) \\(10 \\mathrm{~m} \\mathrm{~s}^{-2}\\) )",
