  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/wrNc70r-dZaR8oVtsiEIeUV1lcelHc_2xQHCzEWYdEk.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{V}=\\ell^3=1 \\mathrm{~m}^3 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{~m}=1 \\times 1000=1000 \\mathrm{~kg} ; \\mathrm{W}=\\mathrm{mgh}=1000 \\times 10 \\times \\frac{1}{2}=5000 \\mathrm{~J}\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
